Granting and revoking table access.

```sql
-- Give analyst read-only access
GRANT SELECT ON sales.orders TO analyst_role;

-- Let a role execute a procedure
GRANT EXECUTE ON PROCEDURE give_raise TO hr_role;

-- Remove insert rights
REVOKE INSERT ON sales.orders FROM intern_user;
```

Privileges cascade: revoking from a role removes it for all members.
